<title>USA: Hewlett-Packard Co Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Hewlett-Packard Co Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>PALO ALTO, Feb 18 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		     Jan 31 1997		Jan 31 1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.87		    $0.75	 </p>
<p> Net		 912,000		  790,000     </p>
<p> Revs		10,295,000	     9,288,000   </p>
<p> Avg shrs	  1,047,000		1,052,000   </p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>First Call consensus estimate for Q1 1997 was $0.75/shr.</p>
</text>
